I've come across today!</i>

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:22.130
<b><i>ya</i></b>

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:22.670
<b><i>ya Boy</i></b>

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:22.880
<b><i>ya Boy KONG</i></b>

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.000
<b><i>ya Boy KONGMING!</i></b>

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:33.000
<b>Records of the</b>

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:33.000
<b>Three Kingdoms</b>

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.580
<i>That hat...</i>

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.420
<i>It's Kongming's from the Three Kingdoms, right?</i>

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.630
<i>Huh? Is that a costume? Street clothes?</i>

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.420
<i>No, no, no! Ignore him!</i>

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:43.540
<i>I bet that guy's unhinged!</i>

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.920
<i>If I take notice of him, I lose.</i>

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.130
<i>Ignore him...</i>

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.630
<i>Pay him no mind!</i>

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.830
You totally are Kongming!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.670
Uh, excuse me!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.000
Never mind!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.210
I'm sorry.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:03.710
Aw, so you've noticed me.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:10.040
Long ago, there was a man called King Wen
who created the foundation of the Zhou state.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.380
Yeah?

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:15.290
When King Wen went to see
Tai Gong Wang at the Wei River,

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:20.630
the latter, who was fishing, kept his eyes on his line,
not once looking over his shoulder.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.630
Uh, what're you talking about?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.460
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.580
Please continue.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.960
No matter how much time passed,
Tai Gong Wang never looked back.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:34.670
Even so, it is said King Wen never interfered
with Tai Gong Wang's fishing,

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:37.960
simply standing behind him until sundown.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:43.710
Tai Gong Wang, impressed by King Wen's
thoughtfulness, felt inclined to join him.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.790
He performed many great services,

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:49.290
laying the foundation for the
Zhou dynasty's 800-year reign.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.710
<i>Yep...</i>

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.170
<i>He's one of those weirdos you'd best not interact with.</i>

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:58.420
It is a historical event that says,
"To respect a sage, act thusly."

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.710
Is that right?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:04.170
And yet I ended up distracting you, O sage.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.830
Please forgive my rudeness.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.000
Huh?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.210
What is it?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.330
"Sage"?

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.330
Yes.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.790
Like, somehow who's really wise?

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.040
Yes, a sage.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.500
Who're you talkin' about?

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:25.000
Three-time consecutive champ of DRB,
the most eminent rap battle competition.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.790
Known by nicknames like "The Word Magician,"
"The Precision Tool of Rhyme,"

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:31.790
and "The Rap World's Master of Invention":

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.830
Kabetaijin.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:36.630
I speak of you.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.380
What's this?
Did you look into me?

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:44.380
Did Sekitoba put you up to this?

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:45.580
No.

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:49.670
I am familiar with the name
"Sekitoba Kung Fu," however.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:50.830
I see.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:56.580
You know, Sekitoba really was a wonderful horse.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.040
What?

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:03.580
In fact, without letting Guan Yu know,
I once secretly rode Sekitoba.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.540
However, the horse didn't take to me.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:11.250
Despite appearances, I actually have some
confidence in my horsemanship,

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.420
but I didn't last a mere 10 seconds.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:17.040
Oh, how I was again made to see
the greatness of Guan Yu,

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.000
who rode Sekitoba masterfully.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.290
Um, okay.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.500
Sure.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:23.040
However...

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:27.250
it looks to me that your face is sallow
and you are unwell.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.830
Perhaps a stomach ulcer from excessive stress?

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.500
Am I wrong?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.290
You one of those spiritual folk?

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.250
I don't need any religious advice.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.290
Ahem...

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:43.710
Actually, I’d like you to join up with a
certain singer for a certain event.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.000
A delicate man such as yourself needs a partner,

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.080
whether a singer or a DJ.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.290
If you join forces, surely your world would expand.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.000
Don't need one.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.630
Besides, I won't rap in front of people anymore.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.170
But is that really true?

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:05.080
What?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.540
Ah, a-hem. Ahem.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.880
Well then, allow me a verse.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:13.080
The sky's a halved gourd, the land a go board

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.330
Dividing between white and black,
vying for honor and shame

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.250
In the previous world and this one,
the essence remains the same

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.040
Th-this's ridiculous.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.380
I won't play your games.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.960
Nay!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:29.170
A scholar, away for three days

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:32.580
With fresh eyes, look out for his new ways

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:36.210
The point is far-reaching, that land is far-off

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.330
Discerning insight, foolish nonsense

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.790
White, black, red, blue, black alike!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.580
<i>This guy's bad news!</i>

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:47.210
Not dyed in any color at all, that is music

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:48.880
For those who know, calm and comfort

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.670
For those who don't, moil and toil

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.960
<i>Why are his words flooding into my ears?!</i>

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:57.580
In Nanyang a hermit is found,
in Tokyo's Shibuya Kabe's around

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.630
Hah, soundly sleeping, doggedly lying flat

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:08.170
Kabetaijin, how long to you intend to slumber?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.420
"Doggedly lying flat"?

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.130
Then, one-on-one I'll chat.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:24.290
You know, that was more of a sutra than a rap.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:30.210
Next Saturday, I am holding a rap-battle event
at BB Lounge in Shibuya.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.880
Will you come and face off with me there?

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.250
Give it a rest!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:39.460
If I win, I'd like you to consider joining up
with that singer I mentioned.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:42.250
But should I lose...

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.130
I shall grant you one wish.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.920
You a genie in a lamp?

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:53.460
Dear me, I can't believe I forgot to introduce myself.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:02.630
I am Zhuge Liang, courtesy name Kongming.

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.830
You know, you're a strange one.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.710
"Strange," eh?

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.580
At this point in time, being told that is rather nostalgic.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.420
<i>I wish they'd all just leave me alone.</i>

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.420
<i>Why's it gotta be me?!</i>

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.040
<i>Ow!</i>

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.790
There's no way I can do what they ask!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.330
A sheathed sword gets rusted,
your ability to use it busted!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.920
How long do you intend to slumber?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.130
Dammit!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.790
<i>I can't let 'em get to me!</i>

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.000
<i>Ignore them!</i>

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.210
<i>Pay 'em no mind!</i>

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:49.830
What's the matter?

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.540
Ah, n-nothing much!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:55.080
I was just wondering how things
are going with that rapper.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:56.790
Oh, I see.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:21:00.500
Actually, I wanted to ask for you help on that front, Eiko.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:10.580
I'd like to ask you to sing during the breaks
in tomorrow's rap battle.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.170
That is the set list.

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:14.210
Bye, then.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.000
Hey, wait! Hold up!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.210
What's your strategy this time around?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:24.880
"To get the enemy to move as you wish,
show them something to their benefit to entice them."

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:25.880
Huh?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.750
<i>Sun Tzu's The Art of War.</i>

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:30.460
I don't get it.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:33.670
In any case, I am counting on you.

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:37.330
Uh, hey! They're really gonna show, right?

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.130
The rapper, I mean.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.000
Yes, he will come.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.880
I am sure it.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.710
<i>I'll just pop in.</i>

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.540
<i>One peek inside and that's it.</i>

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:10.670
Wake up, baby phoenix!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:13.460
<b>Kongming</b>

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:14.960
Hey DJ

